OL,3,ACritics celebrate Celine Dion's
OL,4,A'high-stakes' comeback show in Paris
OL,5,
OL,6,FIconic Canadian pop singer Celine Dion
OL,7,Fhas kicked off her long-awaited
OL,8,Fcomeback show in Paris on Saturday,
OL,9,Fafter a six-year hiatus due to health
OL,10,Fissues.
OL,12,FThe 58-year-old superstar was diagnosed
OL,13,Fwith a rare neurological disorder
OL,14,Fcalled stiff person syndrome in 2022,
OL,15,Fwhich forced her to pull back from
OL,16,Ftouring.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
